   "text": "@HealthGovInst Our ASC received a $0.01 payment for a $60,000 case. I sent it to our US senator.  \n\nWe MUST track initial payments vs QPA vs IDR award. \n\nTheir brazen belligerent violations of the QPA requirements of the NSA are astounding. \n\nThe must be held accountable.",
