   "conversationId": "2088716514690220195",
   "text": "That’s true of so many specialists.\n\nThose in network specialists churn and burn.\n\nI own two practices with ten providers between the two. One in network practice with its own ASC and one out of network with its ASC.\n\nGuess which surgeons are happy and making more.  \n\nThese consolidated health networks harm patients and practitioners. Private practice groups must end insurance contracts that don’t make sense. Otherwise, they’ll shut down or if they can sell to larger organizations for pennies on the dollar. \n\nDon’t play the insurance game. It’s a race to the bottom with insurance companies always coming out in top and physicians working for the MAN.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-08-15T19:56:38.000Z",
