   "text": "Accountability is finally here for the crimes Texas Children’s Hospital committed against children.  The slso criminally committed fraudulent billing with using incorrect biological sex, self identified sex and new name. \n\nBiological Females were dx with low testosterone but were billed as males to Medicaid in order to get paid. \n\nA $10,000,000 settlement. The Biden administration wanted to send this nurse to prison. \n\nThese administrators and physicians must go to prison.  \n\nGender transitioning of adolescents is absolutely abhorrent and those responsible must be held accountable accountabile.  https://x.com/C__Herridge/status/2086607327252140114/video/1",
