   "url": "https://x.com/josonenine/status/2064556744693674425",
   "conversationId": "2064486412003504390",
   "text": "We are completely out of network since 2019. Highly recommend not contracting with any insurance plan especially government plans. \n\nWe have year of year growth of 50% revenue   and will be over $10 million in collections this year. \n\nI expect 2027 we will double our revenue.  \n\nWe collect up front the out of network deductibles and bill insurance the rest. We balance bill the patient if insurance refuses or significantly delays payment. \n\nThis is how healthcare business should be done. \n\nStop contracting with commercial payers. Their networks our all large medical systems and they have no interest in doing business with independent groups or ASCs.",
   "lang": "en",
