   "conversationId": "2059816537222271181",
   "text": "VBC is a misnomer. @DutchRojas.  After 20 yrs doing VBC, to the insurer it’s all about the $$$. They have no interest in doing bundles because they are incentivized by fee for service and lack software to adjudicate claims.  Value based healthcare is making headway with self directed employer agreements.  It cuts out the insurer completely in the equation making it a WIN-WIN-WIN for the patient-employer-clinic/ASC. It’s a lose-lose for the insurance-hospital. 😝💪🙌",
   "lang": "en",
