   "conversationId": "2047385291699179913",
   "text": "We dropped ALL insurance contracts including Federal Plans.  If every private practice, ASC, and hospital did this, then market competition on price would allow patients to choose based on quality and cost. Today it’s smoke and mirrors. \n\nWe are doing well out of network. Insurance companies deny, deny, and lie. No accountability by employers or government. \n\nTime to END insurance contracts and networks.  They only serve @UHC.",
